WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:04.282
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:08.590
What do they see?

3
00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:14.950
They see an ice rink.

4
00:00:14.951 --> 00:00:22.438
The blobs step onto the ice.

5
00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:38.373
They slip on the ice.

6
00:00:38.374 --> 00:00:52.157
They fall on the ice. Ouch!

7
00:00:52.158 --> 00:01:04.979
They stand on the ice.

8
00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:30.161
They slide on the ice.

9
00:01:30.162 --> 00:01:40.151
They skate on the ice.

10
00:01:40.152 --> 00:01:50.430
They hold hands on the ice.

11
00:01:50.431 --> 00:01:55.938
Blobs, do you like the music?

12
00:01:55.939 --> 00:02:04.937
Yes, they do!

13
00:02:04.938 --> 00:02:10.001
Silly blobs.

14
00:02:10.002 --> 00:02:12.771
Good-bye!

